    <panel_attributes>UC01 accepts manual location metadata. F10 and F11 produce their own lifecycle events.
UC02 labels straight-line distance and leaves routes, travel time and opening hours unverified.
UC03 preserves input on provider or validation failure. The user can correct a manual draft.
